SUMMARY:Science Today: America's Symbols
DESCRIPTION:Please join Meredith Morris\, an NCSU student and naturalist center intern\, in the SECU Daily Planet Theater at 1pm on July 1st and July 8th for a presentation on the national symbols of the United States. Meredith will explore the history and cultural impact of America’s national bird\, mammal\, and more! Plus\, learn how to celebrate the 4th of July in an environmentally-friendly way!
URL:https://www.naturalsciences.org/calendar/event/science-today-americas-symbols/2026-07-08/
LOCATION:Nature Research Center\, 121 West Jones Street\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27601\, United States
CATEGORIES:All Ages,Meet the Scientist,SECU Daily Planet Theater,Walk-up Programs
